  "description": "Set in the neon sovereign city state of Elysia, QUIXOTIC RE:SONANCE is a hyper-violent, hyper-sexual dystopian drama inspired by late '80s and early '90s anime, idol culture, the music industry, and above all, the depths of human compassion and cruelty. A story that is brutal as it is gentle and chaotic as it is deliberate. QUIXOTIC RE:SONANCE follows the lives of 3 individuals, Ren, Hoa, and Kei, in a glittering metropolis rotted from the inside out. In a city where dreams are weaponized, their paths collide under lights that conceal more than they reveal. As their lives intertwine, buried secrets surface, rewriting everything they thought they knew. QUIXOTIC is a full sensory experience, a world scored by original music made with the same care as the story itself. One built to move you and stay with you.\n\n_Source: NamiComi_",
